# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Aphrodite .gitignore
# Organized by category. Patterns are ordered so re-includes come AFTER the
# exclusion they override (gitignore semantics: a negation inside an excluded
# directory is a no-op unless the directory itself is re-included first).
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Rust / Cargo ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Bare `target/` (no leading slash) matches build dirs at ANY depth.
target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The Hermes plugin (plugins/aphrodite) is Python - consumers may pip-install
# it, so standard Python build/venv/cache artifacts are ignored.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.eggs/
*.egg
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ruff runs on the release line (Check.yml uses ruff.toml) - local runs drop
# their cache here. pytest/mypy are development-line only and never run here.
.ruff_cache/

# ── Generic artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.lock
*.tar.gz

# ── Aphrodite proxy binary (legacy plugin-dir copy, kept as fallback) ───────
plugins/aphrodite/aphrodite

# ── Local config (not committed) ────────────────────────────────────────────
aphrodite.toml
aphrodite.local.toml

# ── Profiles - keep local, ship only examples ────────────────────────────────
# Local profile dirs stay out of the tree; only profiles/example/ ships.
# Re-include the dir first, then its contents - a bare `!profiles/example/`
# under an excluded `profiles/` is a no-op.
profiles/*
!profiles/example/
!profiles/example/**

# ── IDE / editors ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── OS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── JS / pnpm ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
pnpm-lock.yaml

# ── Secrets (never commit) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.sh
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*

# ── Catch-all leaks / runtime state (the plugin runs against this line) ──────
**/state.db*
**/auth.json
**/auth.lock
**/.hermes_*
**/.skills_*
**/.update_check
**/.DS_Sccp_*.txt